&lt;li&gt;Build a motivated collaborative culture within a hyper-growth team to embody and promote Databricks customer-obsessed, teamwork and diverse culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support increased return on investment of SA involvement in sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure a solution and value-based selling within the field-engineering organization&lt;/li&gt;
